sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Visitor
  participant S as SearchPanel
  participant L as LocatorState
  participant M as MapPane
  participant GA as GA4

  V->>S: Enter postal code 201306 & radius 20km
  S->>L: dispatch search {postal_code_prefix, radius_km, filters}
  L->>L: Filter dealers from `DEALER-001`
  L-->>S: Update results list
  L-->>M: Update map pins & focus
  S->>GA: emit dealer_search_submitted
  V->>S: Click directions on dealer FS-001
  S->>GA: emit dealer_directions_click {dealer_id: FS-001}
  S->>V: Open Google Maps deep link with dealer address
